    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Wisdom Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=IlmzjggKrDB1c9dr]], any [[lookup @target.affects.type activity=IlmzjggKrDB1c9dr]] that starts its turn in a [[lookup @target.template.size activity=IlmzjggKrDB1c9dr]]-foot Emanation originating from the [[lookup @name lowercase]]. <em>Failure:</em> The target suffers one of the following effects:</p><p class=\"feature-trait\"><strong>Captivated (Forager Only).</strong> The target has the &amp;Reference[Charmed apply=false] condition until the end of its next turn. While Charmed, the target has the &amp;Reference[Incapacitated apply=false] condition.</p><p class=\"feature-trait\"><strong>Fearful (Hunter Only).</strong> The target has the &amp;Reference[Frightened apply=false] condition until the end of its next turn.</p><p class=\"feature-trait\"><strong>Mired (Sage Only).</strong> The target takes [[/damage average activity=hYhryWdKIuHOzmO3]] damage, and the target is magically bewildered until the end of its next turn. While bewildered, the target subtracts [[/r 1d4]] from its saving throws.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
